      "tags": [
        "GitHub Copilot",
        "AI Agents"
      ],
      "summary": "If you want to compete, you need to be multi-model. And if you want to take advantage of everything that different AI models have to offer, you need a great harness. But building one that works seamlessly across multiple models and surfaces is incredibly hard. You need to solve for performance, quality, and cost. And... The post Introducing the Microsoft Copilot harness: Unlocking the potential of truly multi-model agentic work appeared first on The Official Microsoft Blog .",
      "relevance_status": "review",
      "relevance_reason": "importance_impact_unconfirmed",
      "signal_slug": "introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-t-2ce02f1",
      "signal_url": "https://sxf.si/signals/introducing-the-microsoft-copilot-harness-unlocking-the-potential-of-t-2ce02f1/",
      "signal_score": 70,
